# Code Owners
# These owners will be the default owners for everything in the repo.
# Unless a later match takes precedence, they will be requested for
# review when someone opens a pull request.

# Global owners
* @repository-owner

# GitHub Actions workflows
/.github/workflows/ @repository-owner @devops-team

# Automation scripts
/scripts/ @repository-owner @automation-team

# Java application
/src/ @repository-owner @backend-team

# Documentation
*.md @repository-owner @docs-team

# Configuration files
*.yml @repository-owner @devops-team
*.json @repository-owner

# Security-sensitive files
/scripts/SECURITY.md @repository-owner @security-team
/.github/workflows/*.yml @repository-owner @security-team
